---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Maxifi Digital | AEO for Expert-Led Brands"
  description="Maxifi Digital is a specialist AEO consultancy helping expert-led organisations become the answer AI cites. Learn who we are, how we work, and how to get in touch."
  currentPage="/about"
>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       HERO
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="page-hero" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT MAXIFI DIGITAL</p>
    <h1 id="about-heading" class="page-h1">
      We exist to make expert organisations the answer AI gives.
    </h1>
    <p class="page-lede">
      AI engines don't cite content randomly. They cite content that is structured,
      entity-rich and authoritative. Maxifi Digital builds the systems that make
      expert organisations that source.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       WHO WE ARE
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="who-heading">
    <p class="s-eyebrow">WHO WE ARE</p>
    <h2 id="who-heading" class="section-h2">A specialist AEO practice</h2>
    <div class="prose-grid">
      <div class="prose-col">
        <p class="prose">
          Maxifi Digital is a specialist Answer Engine Optimisation consultancy.
          We work exclusively with expert-led organisations — professional associations,
          law firms, consultancies, think tanks, conference organisers and regulated-industry
          businesses — that have genuine expertise the world needs to find.
        </p>
        <p class="prose">
          We don't do volume SEO, content mills or generic digital marketing.
          We do one thing: build the structured content, schema layers and authority
          signals that make AI engines cite our clients when buyers ask the questions
          that matter most.
        </p>
        <p class="prose">
          The firm is UK-based and operates globally. Our clients include organisations
          in aviation, legal services, accounting, management consulting, public policy
          and professional membership.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="values-col">
        <div class="value-card">
          <h3 class="vc-title">Depth over volume</h3>
          <p class="vc-body">We work with a small number of clients at a time. Deep beats broad every quarter.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <h3 class="vc-title">Results before rhetoric</h3>
          <p class="vc-body">Every engagement starts with a Snapshot. Every claim is measured against a baseline.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <h3 class="vc-title">Expert-led, always</h3>
          <p class="vc-body">We don't generate content for the sake of volume. We structure and amplify the expertise that already exists.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       HOW WE WORK
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section section--cream" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
    <p class="s-eyebrow">HOW WE WORK</p>
    <h2 id="how-heading" class="section-h2">The Maxifi method</h2>
    <div class="method-steps">
      <article class="method-step">
        <p class="ms-num">01</p>
        <h3 class="ms-title">Snapshot first</h3>
        <p class="ms-body">
          Every engagement starts with a Visibility Snapshot — a structured audit of your
          current citation footprint across five AI engines. No assumptions. No guesswork.
          We work from data.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="method-step">
        <p class="ms-num">02</p>
        <h3 class="ms-title">Build the layer</h3>
        <p class="ms-body">
          We design and build the answer-ready content, schema markup and entity signals
          that close the gap between where you are and where you need to be. Everything
          is specific to your buyer questions and your market position.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="method-step">
        <p class="ms-num">03</p>
        <h3 class="ms-title">Measure the lift</h3>
        <p class="ms-body">
          Citation monitoring across all five engines. Monthly reporting. Quarterly
          re-Snapshots that show compounding growth. We don't stop at delivery —
          we track what moves.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       WHO WE WORK WITH
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="clients-heading">
    <p class="s-eyebrow">WHO WE WORK WITH</p>
    <h2 id="clients-heading" class="section-h2">Our client profile</h2>
    <div class="client-grid">
      {[
        'Professional associations',
        'Conference and event organisers',
        'Law firms',
        'Accounting practices',
        'Management consulting firms',
        'Think tanks',
        'Aviation and governance organisations',
        'Finance and healthcare businesses',
      ].map((name) => (
        <div class="client-pill">{name}</div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="client-note">
      Common thread: deep expertise in a narrow vertical, a need to be cited by AI engines,
      and a readiness to build systems rather than rely on one-off tactics.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       CONTACT
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section section--cream" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div class="contact-text">
        <p class="s-eyebrow">GET IN TOUCH</p>
        <h2 id="contact-heading" class="section-h2">Start a conversation</h2>
        <p class="ct-body">
          The best first step is a Visibility Snapshot — a free, 5-minute check of
          your current AI citation footprint. Or if you'd rather talk first, email us
          directly.
        </p>
        <div class="contact-links">
          <a href="mailto:hello@maxifidigital.com" class="cl-link">
            hello@maxifidigital.com
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="contact-form-wrap">
        <form
          name="contact"
          data-netlify="true"
          data-netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
          id="contact-form"
          class="contact-form"
        >
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact" />
          <p class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true">
            <label>Skip: <input name="bot-field" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label>
          </p>

          <label class="f-label" for="cf-name">Your name</label>
          <input
            class="f-input"
            type="text"
            id="cf-name"
            name="name"
            placeholder="Jane Smith"
            required
          />

          <label class="f-label" for="cf-org">Organisation</label>
          <input
            class="f-input"
            type="text"
            id="cf-org"
            name="organisation"
            placeholder="Acme Consulting"
          />

          <label class="f-label" for="cf-email">Work email</label>
          <input
            class="f-input"
            type="email"
            id="cf-email"
            name="email"
            placeholder="jane@acmeconsulting.com"
            required
          />

          <label class="f-label" for="cf-message">What would you like to discuss?</label>
          <textarea
            class="f-input f-textarea"
            id="cf-message"
            name="message"
            rows="4"
            placeholder="Tell us about your organisation and what you're hoping to achieve..."
          ></textarea>

          <button type="submit" class="f-btn">Send →</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       CTA
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section section--pt0" aria-labelledby="about-cta-heading">
    <div class="cta-box">
      <p class="s-eyebrow cta-eyebrow">START HERE</p>
      <h2 id="about-cta-heading" class="cta-title">
        Not sure where to begin? Start with a Snapshot.
      </h2>
      <p class="cta-body">
        Free. 5 minutes. No sales call. See exactly where AI engines stand on your brand.
      </p>
      <a href="/visibility-snapshot" class="btn-primary">Get my free Snapshot</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<script>
  const form = document.getElementById('contact-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
  const wrap = document.getElementById('contact-form-wrap');
  if (form && wrap) {
    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const body = new URLSearchParams(
        Array.from(new FormData(form)).map(([k, v]) => [k, v.toString()]),
      ).toString();
      try {
        await fetch('/', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded' },
          body,
        });
        wrap.innerHTML =
          '<p class="form-thanks">Thank you — we\'ll be in touch within one business day.</p>';
      } catch {
        form.submit();
      }
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .honeypot { position: absolute; left: -9999px; }

  .form-thanks {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1.55;
    padding: 12px 0;
  }

  /* ── Hero ───────────────────────────────────── */
  .page-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--navy) 0%, var(--navy-deep) 100%);
    color: var(--blue-text);
    padding: 40px 22px 36px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: var(--fs-eyebrow);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--amber-mid);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .page-h1 {
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 auto 12px;
    line-height: 1.18;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .page-lede {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--blue-soft);
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ── Shared ─────────────────────────────────── */
  .s-eyebrow {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--amber-mid);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .section-h2 {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 30px 22px;
    background: var(--cream);
  }

  .section--cream { background: var(--cream-deep); }
  .section--pt0 { padding-top: 0; }

  /* ── Who we are ─────────────────────────────── */
  .prose-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .prose {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #444441;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .values-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }

  .value-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
  }

  .vc-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .vc-body {
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* ── Method ─────────────────────────────────── */
  .method-steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .method-step {
    background: #fff;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px;
  }

  .ms-num {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--amber);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .ms-title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 7px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .ms-body {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* ── Client grid ────────────────────────────── */
  .client-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .client-pill {
    background: #fff;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .client-note {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  /* ── Contact ────────────────────────────────── */
  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 28px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .ct-body {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .contact-links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }

  .cl-link {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid rgba(4, 44, 83, 0.2);
    display: inline-block;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cl-link:hover { border-color: var(--amber); color: var(--amber); }

  /* Form */
  .contact-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

  .f-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    display: block;
  }

  .f-input {
    width: 100%;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(4, 44, 83, 0.18);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    font-size: 11px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--navy);
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .f-input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--amber);
  }

  .f-textarea { resize: vertical; line-height: 1.5; }

  .f-btn {
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--amber);
    color: var(--amber-light);
    padding: 10px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .f-btn:hover { background: #854F0B; }

  /* ── CTA box ────────────────────────────────── */
  .cta-box {
    background: var(--navy);
    padding: 34px 22px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--blue-text);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .cta-eyebrow { color: var(--amber-mid); margin-bottom: 10px; }

  .cta-title {
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .cta-body {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--blue-soft);
    max-width: 400px;
    margin: 0 auto 18px;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--amber);
    color: var(--amber-light);
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover { background: #854F0B; }

  /* ── Responsive ─────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-h1 { font-size: 24px; }
    .prose-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .method-steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cta-title { font-size: 18px; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .btn-primary, .cl-link, .f-input { transition-duration: 0.01ms; }
  }
</style>
